<GenericPage title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="" bodyHtml={`<div class="entry-content single-content"><div><div><div><div><h1 class="has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color">FAQs</h1><p class="has-theme-palette-8-color has-text-color">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) about <a href="/product/choline-chloride-60/" title="Choline Chloride 60% Feed Additive – Corn Cob Carrier China Manufacturer Supply">Choline</a>, <a href="/product/" title="vitamins">Vitamins</a>, and Other <a href="/product/" title="Feed additives">Feed Additive</a> <a href="/product/" title="Feed additives">Products</a> and Our Services</p></div></div></div></div><div class="has-theme-palette9-background-color"><div><div><div><h2>FAQs About Our Company</h2><div class="alignnone"><div class="kt-active-pane-3 kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-left"><div><div class="kt-pane58_f95a85-56"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>Are you a manufacturer?</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>We are not a single factory. Instead, we represent a network of leading enterprises within the industry cluster, operating as a specialized export and service platform company.</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_8e037d-8a"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>Do you offer price advantages?</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>Yes. Our quotations are often more competitive than direct factory prices. Being located at the heart of the production base, we have deep insight into costs and production trends, allowing us to provide the best sourcing options while ensuring product quality meets client requirements.</p></div></div></div><div class="kt-pane58_9664f7-89"><div><button class="kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span><span>What are your key advantages?</span></span></button></div><div><div><p>